    "## Labelling Issues\n",
    "\n",
    "The same category can appear under multiple labels: `\"NYC\"`, `\"nyc\"`, and `\"New York\"` all refer to the same city. Column names can differ across files (`customerID` vs `customer_id`), which silently breaks joins and merges.\n",
    "\n",
    "The fix involves: normalising text with `str.strip()`, `str.lower()` / `str.title()`; building a mapping dictionary from raw labels to canonical ones; and applying it with `map()` or `replace()`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
